WEBVTT

00:00.330 --> 00:03.880
Hi, and welcome to the quarterly product review!
Great to have you here.

00:04.260 --> 00:07.390
In the next minute we'll walk through the roadmap,
show you a quick live demo,

00:07.680 --> 00:10.490
and answer the question we hear most often.
Let's dive in.

00:11.050 --> 00:14.050
First, the roadmap.
The next release is all about speed.

00:14.630 --> 00:18.750
Apps start up to twice as fast,
offline support handles flaky connections gracefully,

00:19.100 --> 00:22.720
and a brand-new reporting module lets you
build dashboards without writing a single query.

00:23.250 --> 00:24.850
Now for the fun part: the demo.

00:25.410 --> 00:27.930
I'm opening a customer record
and changing the shipping address.

00:28.330 --> 00:30.850
Watch the second window.
The moment I hit save,

00:31.110 --> 00:35.120
every other user sees the new address instantly.
No refresh, no extra code.

00:36.080 --> 00:40.240
Finally, your questions.
The big one: when can I try this?

00:40.910 --> 00:44.200
The beta opens next month,
and upgrading is a one-line change.

00:44.970 --> 00:47.480
Thanks so much for watching,
and see you at the next review!
